# Button

## Overview
The Button component is a versatile interactive element for user actions. It supports multiple variants and sizes to fit different design needs.

## Installation

```js
import { Button } from '@veltify/ui';
```

## Examples

### Basic Button

<CodeExample
  title="Basic Button"
  code={`<Button>Click me</Button>`}
>
  <Button>Click me</Button>
</CodeExample>

### Button Variants

<CodeExample
  title="Button Variants"
  code={`<Button variant="primary">Primary</Button>
<Button variant="secondary">Secondary</Button>
<Button variant="ghost">Ghost</Button>
<Button variant="link">Link</Button>
<Button variant="destructive">Destructive</Button>`}
>
  
</CodeExample>

### Button Sizes

<CodeExample
  title="Button Sizes"
  code={`<Button size="default">Default</Button>
<Button size="sm">Small</Button>
<Button size="icon">Icon</Button>`}
>
  <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2">
    <Button size="default">Default</Button>
    <Button size="sm">Small</Button>
    <Button size="icon">I</Button>
  </div>
</CodeExample>

### Link Button

<CodeExample
  title="Link Button"
  code={`<Button href="https://example.com">Link Button</Button>`}
>
  <Button href="https://example.com">Link Button</Button>
</CodeExample>

## API Reference

### Props

| Prop | Type | Default | Description |
|------|------|---------|-------------|
| `variant` | `'primary' \| 'ghost' \| 'secondary' \| 'link' \| 'destructive'` | `'primary'` | Button style variant |
| `size` | `'default' \| 'sm' \| 'icon'` | `'default'` | Size of the button |
| `href` | `string` | `undefined` | When provided, renders as an anchor element |
| `type` | `'button' \| 'submit'` | `'button'` | HTML button type attribute |
| `icon` | `boolean` | `false` | Whether the button is an icon button |
| `children` | `Snippet` | - | Button content |

### Accessibility

- Implements proper ARIA roles and attributes
- Keyboard navigable
- Focus states included for keyboard users
- Screen reader compatible


